TROUBLESHOOTING
---------------
HTTP 404: Check WAR deployment, URL spelling and @WebServlet mapping.
HTTP 500: Check Tomcat logs: tail -f ~/apache-tomcat-9/logs/catalina.out
javax.servlet not found: Use Tomcat 9 and keep servlet-api dependency in pom.xml.
JDBC connection error: Check MariaDB service, database, username/password and DB.java.
JSTL error: Confirm JSTL dependency and Tomcat 9 / JSTL 1.2 compatibility.
Upload permission error: Ensure Tomcat's Linux user can write to ~/servlet-uploads.
Port 8080 busy: sudo ss -ltnp | grep 8080

